l8589976013: 610 l8589976012 l8589975974 # Has value (Has a (Ember Language source (EM), Description), "Programming-language-inspired ASCII source representation of short-Dc Ember Language / EITE Language documents (supporting dc: blocks, say statements, routines, types, and indentation-based blocks). Originally used the repurposed .eite extension before adopting .em, and later renamed ELS (EITE Language source files, .els) in the May 2019 EITE specification.")
